In Figure~\ref{fig:ablations}, we evaluate foundational architectural design decisions on the HOMO-LUMO gap target:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{Feature Encoding:} Multi-axis re-uploading preserves distinct coordinate representations and enables richer Hilbert space expressivity versus destructive summation.
